# 20261026.0+sandstorm1

- Updated to upstream EtherCalc 0.20261026.0 (commit 964efab030d17a78fb2d9b2358c4cd8ef4c6af93).
- Replaced the legacy Node/LiveScript runtime with the upstream TypeScript worker on standalone workerd; retained Bun for legacy-grain migration.
- Preserved CSV and SocialCalc replacement, CSV/CSV-JSON exports, multi-sheet behavior, and legacy dump migration.
- Carried upstream private-room authorization, WebSocket mutation validation, bounded imports/commands, stored-XSS fixes, and other release security hardening.
- Generated an explicit runtime package file list and used a new SPK-FRESH signing identity.

# 20201228.1

- Significantly sped up grain loading.
- Improved mobile responsiveness.
- Imports now add new sheets instead of replacing existing content.
- Several upstream improvements and changes, particularly localization.

# 20160501.1

- Fixed charting in Graph tab.
- Add F2 for input mode toggle.
- Add Russian translation; updated other translations.

# 20160122.5

- Fixed Excel multi-spreadsheet export.
- Allow selecting entire rows and columns.

# 20150901.1

- Updated "Description" metadata as per Kenton.

# 20150822.1

- Initial release to Sandstorm App Market.
